Package: hermes
Title: Health Economics and Outcomes Research Pipeline on OMOP CDM (Metapackage)
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Gabriel",
           family = "Maeztu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gabriel@iomed.health")
  )
Description: An R metapackage providing an end-to-end analytical ecosystem for Real-World Evidence (RWE) and Health Economics and Outcomes Research (HEOR). Unifies CohortUtilisation (HCRU), CohortCosts (direct medical expenditures), and CohortEconomics (propensity scores, Markov simulation, and Cost-Effectiveness Analysis) on OMOP CDM data. Developed by IOMED.
